WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.399
Week 20: Preterite and Imperfect Together. tell a coherent story explain circumstances identify cause and interruption

2
00:00:08.399 --> 00:00:33.025
Read for the situation. Elena volvía del trabajo cuando vio humo. Mientras llamaba a emergencias, dos vecinos ayudaron a salir a una familia. Los bomberos llegaron y controlaron el incendio. Elena was returning from work when she saw smoke. While she called emergency services, two neighbors helped a family get out. The firefighters arrived and controlled the fire.

3
00:00:33.025 --> 00:00:41.787
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:41.787 --> 00:00:47.755
Reading activities. Reading activity 47; Reading activity 48

5
00:00:47.755 --> 00:00:55.749
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:55.749 --> 00:01:25.847
Model language. Caminaba a casa cuando empezó la tormenta. — I was walking home when the storm began. Mientras todos dormían, sonó la alarma. — While everyone was sleeping, the alarm went off. Ya había poca luz cuando llegamos. — There was already little light when we arrived. De repente, un vecino abrió la puerta. — Suddenly, a neighbor opened the door. Al final resolvimos el problema juntos. — In the end, we solved the problem together.

7
00:01:25.847 --> 00:01:36.001
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
